<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ANGLOVAAL GOLD MINES SEPT QTR NET FALLS.</title>
<headline>ANGLOVAAL GOLD MINES SEPT QTR NET FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Ltd said on Tuesday its gold mining companies posted a net profit after tax and before capital expenditure of 49.1 million rand in the quarter to September 30, against 74 million in the preceding quarter.</p>
<p>Total capital spending for the quarter was 11 million rand against 14 million rand.</p>
<p>Gold production was 8,447 kg versus 8,174 kg, while the average revenue received was 54,200 rand per kg of gold against 52,697 rand/kg in the June quarter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
